NOT included
------------
Two things are worth stating explicitly, because an earlier notices file
implied otherwise.

NO NVIDIA SOFTWARE IS REDISTRIBUTED. GPU support is provided by lib\nvptxrt.dll,
which is built from this repository and imports nvcuda.dll -- a component of
the NVIDIA display driver already installed on the user's machine. No CUDA
Toolkit, CUDA redistributable, NVSHMEM or other NVIDIA SDK component is present
in this package, and no NVIDIA licence applies to it.

NO MSVC TOOLCHAIN IS REDISTRIBUTED. Linking uses the bundled LLD, and the MSVC
and UCRT import libraries are located on the user's own Visual Studio or Build
Tools installation at build time; see vsenv.cmd.


